<section class="article">
	<div class="article__container">
		<header class="article__header" data-anim="">
			<div class="article__eyebrow">Inside TaskManager</div>
			<h2 class="article__title">
				<i class="fa-regular fa-newspaper"></i> Feature Deep Dive
			</h2>
			<p class="article__meta">~ 5 min read • Recently updated</p>
			<p class="article__lead">TaskManager helps teams plan work, collaborate smoothly, and track progress in one shared workspace. Here’s a quick tour of the features you’ll use every day.</p>
		</header>

		<article class="article__content">
			<section class="article__section" data-anim="">
				<h3>
					<i class="fa-regular fa-lightbulb"></i> Plan Projects Clearly
				</h3>
				<p>
					Create new projects in minutes, add descriptions and timelines, and categorize as <em>Personal</em> or <em>Team</em>. Use status columns to reflect phases like Planning, In Progress, and Completed.
				</p>
				<ul>
					<li>Fast create/edit/delete with a clean modal</li>
					<li>Drag-and-drop to reorder cards and change status</li>
					<li>Manage members and roles within the same flow</li>
				</ul>
			</section>

			<div class="article__row" data-anim="">
				<figure class="article__figure">
					<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519389950473-47ba0277781c?q=80&w=1600&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Project planning" />
					<figcaption>A visual project board keeps everyone aligned at a glance.</figcaption>
				</figure>
				<section class="article__section">
					<h3>
						<i class="fa-solid fa-people-group"></i> Collaborate in Real Time
					</h3>
					<p>Assign tasks, discuss in comments, and share files on each task. Subtle toast notifications help you never miss an update.</p>
					<ul>
						<li>Thread-like comments with quick delete/edit</li>
						<li>File uploads with basic history tracking</li>
						<li>Flexible roles: Member, Leader, Admin</li>
					</ul>
				</section>
			</div>

			<blockquote class="article__quote" data-anim="">
				“TaskManager helped our team cut 40% of time in status meetings.”
			</blockquote>

			<section class="article__section" data-anim="">
				<h3>
					<i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line"></i> Track & Report
				</h3>
				<p>Visit the Reports page for KPIs and simple charts that tell you what’s moving, what’s blocked, and what’s coming next.</p>
				<ul class="article__callouts">
					<li>
						<i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Clear KPIs (Open, Done, Cycle time)
					</li>
					<li>
						<i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Per‑project progress with completion %
					</li>
					<li>
						<i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> Workload by assignee to balance effort
					</li>
				</ul>
			</section>
		</article>
	</div>
</section>

